{66}{It would be my pleasure.  The Halcyon Order is a small movement and our belief system is simple. We focus on the truth that all sentient beings were created to dwell together in peace and harmony.  Violence, anger, deception, greed, all these things are foreign to our true pacifistic nature, and should be avoided at all costs.}{It would be my pleasure.  The Halcyon Order is a small movement and our belief system is simple. We focus on the truth that all sentient beings were created to dwell together in peace and harmony.  Violence, anger, deception, greed, all these things are foreign to our true pacifistic nature, and should be avoided at all costs.}{}{}{}{}
